Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.32,JP,,0,0,0,,鍵もかけないで。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.32,VI,,0,0,0,,cửa cũng không khóa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:01.78,JP,,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.32,0:00:01.78,VI,,0,0,0,,Hử?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:06.87,JP,,0,0,0,,何者だ！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.91,0:00:06.87,VI,,0,0,0,,Kẻ nào đó!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:11.25,JP,,0,0,0,,しんのすけ！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.15,0:00:11.25,VI,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:12.79,JP,,0,0,0,,おかえりなさい。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.25,0:00:12.79,VI,,0,0,0,,Bố về rồi ạ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.67,JP,,0,0,0,,はーい。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.67,VI,,0,0,0,,Dạaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:14.57,JP,,0,0,0,,おい、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.13,0:00:14.57,VI,,0,0,0,,Này,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:15.19,JP,,0,0,0,,みさえ…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.57,0:00:15.19,VI,,0,0,0,,Misae…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:16.37,JP,,0,0,0,,隊長！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.67,0:00:16.37,VI,,0,0,0,,Đội trưởng!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.23,JP,,0,0,0,,怪しい者を発見しました！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.23,VI,,0,0,0,,Phát hiện kẻ khả nghi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.15,JP,,0,0,0,,はいはい。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.15,VI,,0,0,0,,Rồi rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.09,JP,,0,0,0,,ご苦労さん。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.09,VI,,0,0,0,,Vất vả rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:21.47,JP,,0,0,0,,何してたんだよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.09,0:00:21.47,VI,,0,0,0,,Đang làm gì thế hả?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:23.45,JP,,0,0,0,,停電ごっこ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.01,0:00:23.45,VI,,0,0,0,,Chơi giả vờ mất điện.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.81,JP,,0,0,0,,なんだよ、バカバカしい。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.81,VI,,0,0,0,,Cái gì vậy, vớ vẩn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.11,JP,,0,0,0,,で、そのライトどうしたんだ？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.11,VI,,0,0,0,,Thế cái đèn đó ở đâu ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:32.65,JP,,0,0,0,,新しいの買っちゃった。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.99,0:00:32.65,VI,,0,0,0,,Em lỡ mua cái mới rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:34.85,JP,,0,0,0,,備えあれば憂いなし。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.65,0:00:34.85,VI,,0,0,0,,Có chuẩn bị thì không lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.39,JP,,0,0,0,,母ちゃんの大好きな大特売だったの。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.85,0:00:37.39,VI,,0,0,0,,Đang có đợt giảm giá lớn mà mẹ mê lắm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.19,JP,,0,0,0,,まったく、無駄遣いして。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.19,VI,,0,0,0,,Thật là, lại tiêu hoang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:42.33,JP,,0,0,0,,でもこれ結構すごいのよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.63,0:00:42.33,VI,,0,0,0,,Nhưng cái này xịn lắm đấy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.57,JP,,0,0,0,,ねえ、しんちゃん。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.57,VI,,0,0,0,,Nhỉ, Shin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.07,0:00:44.95,JP,,0,0,0,,ほい。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.07,0:00:44.95,VI,,0,0,0,,Dạ.
